s. DSH Switchboard runs outside the active Harness process to inspect Pr"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ofiles, run health checks, preview Bundle changes, create backups, and roll changes back safely."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"There are no accounts, hosted backends, behavioral analytics, telemetry, background registry checks,"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" or automatic upgrades by default. Real runtime data stays in local SQLite. Profile changes always b"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"egin with a plan, require user confirmation before writing, and leave an auditable transaction recor"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"in with a plan, require user confirmation before writing, and leave an auditable transaction record."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Five components"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Component | Everyday use | Tools |\n| --- | --- | ---: |\n| `@dsh-toolbox/product-research-workbench"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"` | Import URL or text evidence, organize findings, evaluate opportunities, back up projects, and ge"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"nerate Markdown/HTML reports. | 12 |\n| `@dsh-toolbox/context-switchboard` | Route tasks into bounded"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" contexts, activate native runtime context, and support rollback. | 10 |\n| `@dsh-toolbox/plugin-pref"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"light` | Inspect local Bundles before installation for package semantics, capabilities, policy, SBOM"},{"id":"p14s6","text":" data, and fingerprints. | 2 |\n| `@dsh-toolbox/compatibility-radar` | Discover Bundles, compare them"},{"id":"p14s7","text":" with a target runtime, save and compare snapshots, and generate upgrade reports. | 7 |\n| `@dsh-tool"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"box/dsh-switchboard` | Discover DSH Profiles, inspect Bundles, plan and validate changes, create bac"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"kups and reports, and roll back safely. | CLI / control plane |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The first four components are independently installable DSH Profile Bundles. The fifth is the unifie"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"d local control plane. Product Research Workbench and related reports support Markdown and HTML outp"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ut, while runtime data is stored in SQLite by default."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Online demo vs. local installation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| Capability | Online demo | Local installation |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Explore four views and a fixed activity sidebar | Available | Available |\n| Switch Profiles, filte"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"r activity, and review Bundle plans | Simulated in browser memory | Connected to real local data |\n|"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" Run `dsh --dump-config` health checks | Simulated success result | Real command execution |\n| Write"},{"id":"p18s4","text":" Profiles, create backups, roll back, and generate reports | No writes; resets on refresh | Real exe"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"cution after plan confirmation |\n| Data destination | Current browser memory | SQLite and private di"},{"id":"p18s6","text":"rectories on the user's computer |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- Node.js `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0` (`node:sqlite` is built in)\n- npm, for packing the local bundles\n- "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"`@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.1-rc.2`\n- A local DSH profile you are allowed to modify"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Read-only Switchboard inspection works without the DSH CLI on `PATH`. Applying or rolling back a cha"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"nge requires the CLI by default because a successful `dsh --profile <name> --dump-config` is the run"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"CLI by default because a successful `dsh --profile <name> --dump-config` is the runtime safety gate."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The tested runtime combination is:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Component | Tested version |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| DeepSeek Harness | `0.1.1-rc.2` |\n| DSH Tools | `0.1.1-rc.2` |\n| Cordis | `4.0.1` |\n| Node.js | `2"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"4.x` and the declared `22.19+` range |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"CI runs the full check and package dry-run matrix on Ubuntu with Node.js `22.19.0` and `24.x`. A sep"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"arate `windows-latest` job verifies that Switchboard can detect and execute npm-installed `dsh.cmd` "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"shims without enabling shell execution."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Install the pinned DSH CLI if it is not already available:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Five-minute installation"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Clone the source, create the four npm tarballs, and install them into one DSH profile:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The final command should show all four bundle layers. Start DSH with the same profile:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"You may install only the tarballs you need. Packing does not execute plugin code and does not requir"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"e repository dependencies to be installed. Direct checkout-path installation is also possible after "},{"id":"p33s3","text":"`npm install` at the repository root, but tarballs match npm packaging semantics and are the validat"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"the repository root, but tarballs match npm packaging semantics and are the validated portable flow."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Each package pins the small DSH tool-definition runtime needed for reliable out-of-tree installation"},{"id":"p34s2","text":". There are no install lifecycle scripts."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Open the DSH Switchboard GUI"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"DSH Switchboard is a local settings app for DeepSeek Harness. It shows which Profiles and Profile Bu"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ndles are installed, checks whether a Profile can start, previews every change, and keeps a backup s"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"o the change can be rolled back safely."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The navigation opens four working views in the center panel:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- **DSH Profiles** — inspect a Profile, run its DSH health check, review installed Bundles, and plan"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" enable/disable changes.\n- **Plugins** — view the Bundle inventory and its compatibility status.\n- *"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"*Activity** — inspect local plans, validations, applied changes, and rollbacks.\n- **Settings** — rev"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"iew the detected DSH runtime and local data locations."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Recent activity remains visible on the right while you move between views. Long lists scroll inside "},{"id":"p39s2","text":"their own panels, so the overall application frame stays fixed and readable."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### Compatibility Radar"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Example request:"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Before changing DSH or Cordis versions, save a second snapshot and use `compatibility_diff` or `comp"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"atibility_report` to identify regressions. Radar never upgrades software automatically."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

